  rewrite: declare `c: cursor ?` in inbox and append `after c` to this memberships page, keeping its current predicate, direction and column order; or declare `cap 50 by principal` on table memberships if that is the intended group limit, then read `memberships where .principal = <value>` without a page clause; other metered work can still cut the read
